<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questDescription->A group of kiiro guerrillas who are being pursued by the enemy have retreated near [map_definite], they ask you for helping them stop the enemy in [map_definite], and want to stop here for a short time to get some respite. The group of [enemyFaction_pawnsPlural] is composed of: \n\n[raid/raidPawnKinds]</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questDescription->一支正在被敵人追擊的綺羅游擊隊撤退到了[map_definite]附近，她們懇求你能在[map_definite]幫助一起阻擊敵人，並且希望能夠在這裡短暫停留以便得到片刻的喘息。[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural]的隊伍構成: \n\n[raid/raidPawnKinds]</li>
  </Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questName->[aThe] kiiro guerrilla [alms]</li>
    <li>aThe->A group of</li>
    <li>aThe->A team</li>
    <li>aThe->A crowd of</li>
    <li>alms->asking for help</li>
    <li>alms->in need of help</li>
    <li>alms->seeking for help</li>
    <li>alms->need help</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questName->[aThe][alms]綺羅游擊隊</li>
    <li>aThe->一群</li>
    <li>aThe->一隊</li>
    <li>aThe->一支</li>
    <li>alms->需要幫助的</li>
    <li>alms->請求支援的</li>
    <li>alms->尋求幫助的</li>
    <li>alms->走投無路的</li>
  </Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN: {BASELABEL} chasing kiiro guerrilla -->
  <Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.root.nodes.Delay-1.node.parms.customLetterLabel.value.slateRef>{BASELABEL}追擊綺羅游擊隊</Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.root.nodes.Delay-1.node.parms.customLetterLabel.value.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: {BASETEXT}\nThese [enemyFaction_pawnsPlural] is coming for kiiro guerrillas. -->
  <Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.root.nodes.Delay-1.node.parms.customLetterText.value.slateRef>{BASETEXT}\n這些[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural]是為追擊綺羅游擊隊而來。</Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.root.nodes.Delay-1.node.parms.customLetterText.value.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: leave in {0}. -->
  <Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.root.nodes.ExtraInspectStringAddOn.extraInspectString.slateRef>于{0}后離開。</Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.root.nodes.ExtraInspectStringAddOn.extraInspectString.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: kiiro guerrilla leave -->
  <Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.root.nodes.GreaterOrEqual.node.node.nodes.AnyPawnAlive.node.label.slateRef>游擊隊離開</Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.root.nodes.GreaterOrEqual.node.node.nodes.AnyPawnAlive.node.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The kiiro guerrillas have finished their rectification, and they will leave now. -->
  <Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.root.nodes.GreaterOrEqual.node.node.nodes.AnyPawnAlive.node.text.slateRef>綺羅游擊隊已經完成了整頓，她們將離開你的殖民地。</Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.root.nodes.GreaterOrEqual.node.node.nodes.AnyPawnAlive.node.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Relation with kiiro guerrilla broke down -->
  <Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.root.nodes.permitFactionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>綺羅游擊隊關係破裂</Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.root.nodes.permitFactionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: due to we are now hostile to kiiro, our relation with kiiro guerrilla broke down and now they treat us as enemy. -->
  <Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.root.nodes.permitFactionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>由於現在與綺羅族處於敵對關係，我們與綺羅游擊隊的關係破裂了，她們現在視我們為敵人。</Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.root.nodes.permitFactionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  
  <!-- UNUSED -->
  <Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.LetterLabelChasing.value.slateRef>{BASELABEL}追擊綺羅游擊隊</Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.LetterLabelChasing.value.slateRef>
  <Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.LetterTextChasing.value.slateRef>{BASETEXT}\n這幫[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural]是爲了追擊綺羅游擊隊而來。</Kiiro_GuerrillaAssist.LetterTextChasing.value.slateRef>
  
</LanguageData>